# Copy this file to ".env.local" (git-ignored) to bake a DEMO API key into your local build,
# so you don't have to paste it into the popup.
#
# WARNING: a key embedded in an extension is NOT secret. Anyone who has the built extension can read
# it from the service worker's source. Use it only for a demo on your own machine, set a spend limit
# on the key, and revoke it afterwards. `npm run zip` refuses to package a build that contains it.
#
# The key is sent to the host in src/shared/apiConfig.ts. A key typed in the popup overrides this one.
VITE_EMBEDDED_API_KEY=
